---
title: Bee's Knees
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Classic cocktail, number 29 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @gin{2%fl_oz}, @lemon juice{0.75%fl_oz} and @honey syrup{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with a @lemon peel{1%twist}.

> Honey syrup is honey and warm water, equal parts.
